{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 921960, "segment_id": "W37RwQdxJr", "segment_broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Katie Couric (New York)", "segment_description": null, "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 921960, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 921960, "segment_id": "VMVhWTF9FR", "segment_broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "segment_title": "Economy: Stock Market / Levitt Interview ", "segment_description": "(Studio: Katie Couric) The global selloff of stocks amid fear of a recession reported; Stock Market Report.  \n\n(Studio: Anthony Mason) The impact of the volatility of the stock market featured; the drops in the markets in Japan, Hong Kong and Britain, the fall in Dow futures, job cuts for corporations, including Chrysler, and existing home sales cited. [On the street, 3 PEOPLE \u2013 react.] [Russell Investments Erik RISTUBEN&#134;- says people need cash.] [Meridian Equity Partners Jonathan CORPINA&#134;- says the market is fearful and confused; predicts the Dow will go lower.] [UBS Financial Services Arthur CASHIN&#134;- says something very powerful is looming.]  \n\n(Studio: Katie Couric) Live interview held with former SEC chairman Arthur Levitt&#134; about the panic in the stock market. [From Stamford, Connecticut, LEVITT \u2013 notes the uncertainty of investors; states it would be a mistake to give up and sell everything; says subprime mortgages are history; blames both Democrats and Republicans for failing to oversee this market.] ", "segment_duration": 290, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 921961, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 921960, "segment_id": "oUZB7R4IOB", "segment_broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "segment_title": "Money Watch (Oil and Gas Prices)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Katie Couric) The drop in oil prices reported.  \n\n(London: Elizabeth Palmer) OPEC\u2019s decision to cut oil production to stop the slide in prices featured. [Merrill Lynch and Co., Inc. Francisco BLANCH&#134;- says it\u2019s going to be difficult to implement deep cuts.]  \n\n(Studio: Katie Couric) Statistics showing a drop in miles driven by Americans due to high gas prices cited. ", "segment_duration": 110, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63340.0", "legacy_segment_id": 921962, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 921960, "segment_id": "MmuzK7ggKX", "segment_broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "segment_title": "Campaign 2008 / McCain ", "segment_description": "(Studio: Katie Couric) Senator Barack Obama shown in Honolulu, where he is visiting his sick grandmother.   (Denver: Chip Reid) Complaints from some Republicans about Senator John McCain\u2019s campaign featured; scenes shown of a rally in Denver; criticism of McCain\u2019s choice of Governor Sarah Palin from former Pennsylvania Governor Tom Ridge quoted; details given of his campaign themes; ad and clip from \u201cSaturday Night Live\u201d shown. [Former Denver Broncos quarterback John ELWAY&#134;- says he knows about comebacks.] [McCAIN \u2013 campaigns.]    (Studio: Katie Couric; Washington: Bob Schieffer) The struggle for McCain\u2019s campaign discussed. The guests for \u201cFace the Nation\u201d noted. ", "segment_duration": 200, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63450.0", "legacy_segment_id": 921963, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 921960, "segment_id": "N0iLYvCwg0", "segment_broadcast_id": "dnr4Up8VrW", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Katie Couric)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63650.0", "legacy_segment_id": 921964, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"b